				<wikidot:authorName>Nagiros</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>4665703</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>From the <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/image-use-policy">Image Use Policy</a>:</p> <blockquote> <p>Only images verifiably under licenses that include some or all of [the terms of CC SA-BY 3.0] and no more, or which are verifiably in the public domain, are permissible for use.</p> </blockquote> <p>You're free to use compatible licenses. Which are you working with?</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
